      "author_association": "NONE",
      "body": "On head `960efec32a4abc173e1d577543048a88f750b818`, the two checks in [run 34741431427](https://github.com/deepspeedai/DeepSpeed/actions/runs/34741431427) are CANCELLED. The other run passed test collection but skipped the main DeepSpeedAI CI job; DCO passes. Could a maintainer enable/re-run the required test job on this head? These statuses do not provide a test assertion failure to diagnose.\n",
